WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
Open Publish a Folder and tap Choose a Folder.

00:03.000 --> 00:09.000
Choose MyNotes under On My iPhone, then tap Open.

00:09.000 --> 00:14.000
Review the files. Sensitive filenames start unchecked.
Uncheck any notes you want to keep on your device.

00:14.000 --> 00:30.000
Enter the author name and email for your first commit.
Use your own GitHub noreply address for privacy.

00:30.000 --> 00:40.000
Choose a repository name, such as my-notes.

00:40.000 --> 00:45.267
Choose Private or Public.
Sign in with GitHub to prepare the commit and publish.
